        "component_connections": "RadarProcessor (P->) IF_Radar_Fusion -> FusionAlgorithm; CameraProcessor (P->) IF_Camera_Fusion -> FusionAlgorithm; FusionAlgorithm (P->) IF_Fusion_Planner -> PathPlanner; PathPlanner (Client->) IF_Planner_Actuation -> ActuationInterface (Server); System components (Fusion/Planner/Actuation) -> IF_HMI_Status -> HMIManager; HMIManager -> IF_Mode_Switch -> PathPlanner/Fusion; Fusion/Planner -> IF_Parameter_Service -> Parameter service component (logical).",
        "data_flow_paths": "RawSensorFrame -> RadarProcessor/CameraProcessor -> Object/DetectionList -> FusionAlgorithm -> FusedObjectList -> PathPlanner -> ControlCommand -> ActuationInterface -> Vehicle actuators; Status/Alerts aggregated -> HMIManager.",
        "control_flow_paths": "HMIManager triggers ModeSwitch -> PathPlanner/Fusion (mode arbitration); PathPlanner invokes ActuationInterface via synchronous call and waits for ActuationAck; Emergency triggers (AEB) from Fusion/Planner can preempt planner outputs and cause immediate Actuation synchronous commands."
      },
      "architecture_rationale": {
        "design_decisions": "采用传感器处理分离与集中融合的架构以实现可扩展性和可替换性；传输使用S/R接口用于周期性数据流，Client-Server用于关键命令确认；Fusion作为中心化时间同步与关联点以减少Planner复杂度；Actuation作为ECU抽象层负责安全检查与底层总线细节；HMI独立为服务组件处理模式切换与显示；元素预选（P/R/ServerCall等）以满足Round2生成ARXML的确定性约束。",
        "tradeoff_analysis": "集中Fusion简化Planner输入但增加单点计算与延迟风险；采用Client-Server保证命令确认但增加交互延迟；S/R最新值策略最小化延迟但可能丢帧，采用小队列平衡抖动；将Actuation做为ECU抽象提高安全隔离但需额外接口映射工作。",
        "alternative_considerations": "可将部分融合逻辑下沉到传感器处理器实现分布式融合以减轻中心负载；Planner->Actuation也可改为S/R并引入确认主题以降低阻塞，但会降低确认即时性；HMI可以通过轻量化诊断总线而非S/R聚合以减少数据复制。",
        "risk_assessment": "主要风险为延迟/抖动导致AEB响应不足、单点故障（Fusion）影响整体功能、Client-Server超时导致命令未确认；缓解措施：周期与队列配置、超时与重试策略、降级模式、组件冗余或分布式融合备份、严格的测试与性能验证。"
      },
